Understand what this script does

PowerShell command	      Purpose
Get-VM	                  Retrieves virtual machines
Get-VMSnapshot	          Retrieves checkpoints
Get-Date	                Gets current date and time
AddHours(-74)	            Calculates the 74-hour cutoff
Where-Object	            Filters expired checkpoints

Important: This script only retrieves and identifies checkpoints. It does not delete anything.
